# Only reachable from inside this container's own network namespace (loopback).
ListenAddress 127.0.0.1
AddressFamily inet
Port 22
PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
UsePAM yes
PrintMotd no
PrintLastLog no
X11Forwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
AllowAgentForwarding no
AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
PermitTunnel no
ClientAliveInterval 30
ClientAliveCountMax 4
MaxSessions 6
MaxStartups 10:30:20
LoginGraceTime 60
UseDNS no
AcceptEnv LANG LC_*
